# .env.certify — Optional config for Paper Campaign
#
# No API keys required! Bybit public WebSocket + PaperProvider.
#
# Available overrides (all optional):
#   SYMBOLS       — comma-separated symbols (default: BTCUSDT,ETHUSDT,SOLUSDT)
#   PAPER_BALANCE — initial balance in USDT (default: 10000)
#
# Example:
#   SYMBOLS=BTCUSDT
#   PAPER_BALANCE=50000
